    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>The 150 years from Panangkaran to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balitung">Balitung</a> (760–910) were the apogee of classical Javanese civilisation, when Kalasan, Sewu, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/borobudur">Borobudur</a> and Prambanan rose on the Kedu and Kewu plains.</li><li>Under the Shailendras Javanese fleets raided Tonkin in 767 and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/champa">Champa</a> in 774 and 787, Dharanindra took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nakhon-si-thammarat">Ligor</a> and became <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharaja</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/srivijaya">Srivijaya</a>, and the young <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jayavarman-ii">Jayavarman II</a> lived at the Javanese court before proclaiming <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cambodia">Cambodia</a>'s independence in 802.</li><li>The centre moved to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/east-java">East Java</a> about 929 under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mpu-sindok">Mpu Sindok</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dharmawangsa">Dharmawangsa</a>'s naval invasion of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/srivijaya">Srivijaya</a> in 990 failed, and in 1016–1017 the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassal</a> king of Wurawari destroyed the palace and killed him at his daughter's wedding.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>A 10th-century Arab account describes 1,000 boats of the Waqwaq, probably Javanese or Srivijayan, attacking Qanbaloh on the East African coast in 945–946 for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ivory-trade">ivory</a>, ambergris and Bantu slaves; Javanese inscriptions of 931 and 1053 record labour brought from Jenggi, Zanzibar.</p></aside>
    </section>

